    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, GOLD 3 (severe airflow limitation), group B, confirmed on spirometry; synthetic modern classification linked to his publicly disclosed COPD: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Former smoker, quit about 30 years ago through a cessation program: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

